</section>
<!-- Executive Summary -->
<section style="background:#111;border-left:5px solid #d4af37;padding:35px;border-radius:15px;margin-bottom:45px;">
<h2 style="color:#d4af37;margin-bottom:20px;">
            Executive Summary
        </h2>
<p style="margin-bottom:15px;">
            My professional journey has been built around operational excellence, financial performance,
            guest satisfaction and people development.
        </p>
<p style="margin-bottom:15px;">
            I have managed luxury hospitality operations, supervised multicultural teams of over 100 employees,
            directed food and beverage departments, implemented Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs),
            improved cost controls and successfully delivered operational improvements in highly competitive environments.
        </p>
<p>
            Today I continue to support the hospitality industry through consulting,
            hospitality education, executive mentoring and practical operational guidance
            published on NigelThomas.live.
        </p>
</section>
